<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Cookie Policy — Toolix</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Toolix uses no tracking cookies. Only session cookies from the advertising network. No behavioral tracking." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://toolix.dev/cookies" />
</head>
<body class="bg-[var(--color-bg)] text-[var(--color-text)] font-sans antialiased">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <section class="space-y-6 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">No Behavioral Tracking</h2>
      <p>Toolix does not set first-party tracking cookies and does not use third-party behavioral analytics cookies. We do not collect user profiles, browsing behavior, or personal identification through cookies.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Advertising Cookies</h2>
      <p>A session cookie may be set by the advertising network for ad delivery and frequency capping. This cookie does not contain personally identifiable information. You may block third-party cookies through your browser settings without affecting tool functionality.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Local Storage</h2>
      <p>Tool preferences (theme, recent inputs, streak counters) are saved in browser <code>localStorage</code> or <code>IndexedDB</code>. These are not cookies and are not transmitted to any server. Clearing browser data will reset all stored preferences.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Essential Only</h2>
      <p>There are no "marketing" or "analytics" cookies. Only what is strictly required for basic site operation and advertising delivery.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
